            const vsys = PERSONA + ' ' + nowLine() + ' ' + SITE_ID_LINE + ' ' + (founder ? FOUNDER_MODE + ' ' : '') + 'You CAN see the attached image(s). Several images may be separate pictures or ordered frames of one video; compare them and answer as a whole. Look at it carefully and answer about what is actually visible (text, objects, people\'s clothing/expression, scene). Do not identify real people from their face; if asked who someone is, describe what is visible and ask the user to tell you.';
